  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0: The provider follows the providers of the .NET Community Toolkit, and leaves to ChromaDotNet.Client 2.10.0 what is Chroma's: the upsert that deletes the values that are now null, the copy of the document for the filters, the BM25 indexes, and the filters on the key and on the document. Breaking: ChromaVectorStore and ChromaCollection take a ChromaClient and ownsClient. The registrations take a connection string, or the ChromaClient of the container. CreateBm25Indexes is gone: on Chroma Cloud, creating a collection creates a BM25 index for each full-text indexed string property, and only there a collection offers hybrid search through GetService. A DateTime filter finds the same ticks with the same Kind, and a negated comparison on a nullable property throws a NotSupportedException instead of leaving out the records where the property is null. All the releases: https://github.com/ChromaDotNet/ChromaDB.VectorData/releases",
